    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "| Variable | Purpose | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| `CRAFT_WORKSPACE_ROOT` | Workspace bound to the editor | current project |\n| `CRAFT_EDITOR_UPDATE` | Set to `off` to skip the enhanced editor download | enabled |\n\nNever write secrets, tokens, or private paths into projects or configuration."
    },
    {
      "section": "Extension contract",
      "text": "New skills use the `figcraft-` prefix, declare triggers and boundaries, operate through MCP or the pinned CLI, and reopen after every edit."
    },
